&lt;h2 id="prevent-nail-splitting-wind-bugs-hand-care"&gt;Prevent Nail Splitting: Wind, Bugs, Hand Care&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;She glanced at her hands during a morning coffee break — the soft sheen of care was the quiet reminder that small rituals matter. Yesterday, those same fingers zipped a jacket against a brisk, playful wind that tugged hair loose and fluttered sleeves. It felt cleansing to be outside, to move through air that smelled like rain and lilac. But by evening her skin prickled, a faint bite along the knuckle, and her index nail snagged on a sweater thread. A thin split. The kind you notice at the worst moment, a tiny discomfort that won’t be ignored.&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:group><media:content url="https://blog.nailak.com/images/brand/26.webp" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.nailak.com/images/brand/26.webp"/><media:content url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/03/bugs-insects-you-take-home-with-you-that-carry-on-the-wind-creatures-you-never-thought-could-fly-that-bite-how-to-prevent-nail-splitting/cards/facebook/bugs-insects-you-take-home-with-you-that-carry-on-the-wind-creatures-you-never-t.jpg" medium="image"/><media:thumbnail url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/03/bugs-insects-you-take-home-with-you-that-carry-on-the-wind-creatures-you-never-thought-could-fly-that-bite-how-to-prevent-nail-splitting/cards/facebook/bugs-insects-you-take-home-with-you-that-carry-on-the-wind-creatures-you-never-t.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/03/bugs-insects-you-take-home-with-you-that-carry-on-the-wind-creatures-you-never-thought-could-fly-that-bite-how-to-prevent-nail-splitting/cards/facebook/bugs-insects-you-take-home-with-you-that-carry-on-the-wind-creatures-you-never-t.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://blog.nailak.com/posts/2025/11/03/bugs-insects-you-take-home-with-you-that-carry-on-the-wind-creatures-you-never-thought-could-fly-that-bite-how-to-prevent-nail-splitting/cards/instagram/bugs-insects-you-take-home-with-you-that-carry-on-the-wind-creatures-you-never-t.jpg" medium="image"/><media:t